---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<section class="about-icon-section reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How Our Treks Are <span>More Than Just a Trek</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Every journey with us is carefully crafted for a deeply personal mountain experience.
    </p>

    <div class="about-row">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-blue">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M3 20L12 4l9 16H3z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Not Just a Trek — A Journey That Stays With You</h3>
        <p>
          Every trail we walk is a carefully chosen path into the heart of the Himalayas — not just to witness their grandeur, but to feel them under your skin and soul. Our treks are designed not as bucket list checkmarks, but as life-affirming journeys. At Planethimalayas, we believe a mountain journey is deeply personal — and that belief runs through everything we do.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-row reverse">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-pink">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5
          2 6 4 4 6.5 4c1.74 0 3.41 1.01 4.22 2.61C11.09 5.01 12.76 4 14.5 4
          17 4 19 6 19 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Individual Care, Every Step of the Way</h3>
        <p>
          We keep our groups small and intimate so we can focus on you — your pace, your concerns, your joy. From pre-trek guidance to trail-side support, our leaders walk with intention, offering safety and attention without intrusion. It’s this deep care that turns strangers into friends and walks into memories.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-row">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-green">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M12 20c4.418 0 8-3.582 8-8S16.418 4 12 4
          4 7.582 4 12s3.582 8 8 8zm0 0v-8l4-4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Built on Genuine Love for the Himalayas</h3>
        <p>
          We don’t just operate in the Himalayas — we live and breathe them. From respecting mountain communities to following Leave No Trace ethics, our treks are shaped by humility and care. With Planethimalayas, your trek becomes a way of giving back to the mountains that give us so much.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="section-separator"></div>

<section class="why-choose-section reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Why <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Experience the difference of trekking with genuine mountain experts who truly care.
    </p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card yellow">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 22l-6-4-6 4 1.5-8.5L2 9h7l3-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Trek Leader & Guide</h3>
        <p>
          Led by certified mountaineers with wilderness first aid training, ensuring your safety and confidence at every step.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card purple">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <!-- center person -->
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M5.5 21v-2a6.5 6.5 0 0113 0v2"/>
  
            <!-- left person -->
            <circle cx="5" cy="10" r="3"/>
            <path d="M2 21v-2a5 5 0 015-5h1"/>
  
            <!-- right person -->
            <circle cx="19" cy="10" r="3"/>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a5 5 0 00-5-5h-1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cook & Support Staff</h3>
        <p>
          Our mountain crew comprises local experts who bring unmatched experience, warmth, and deep knowledge of the region.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card blue">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0114 0v2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Small Group Size</h3>
        <p>
          We cap our group departures at just 8 trekkers — ensuring individual attention, deeper connections, and better trail discipline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card green">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5.25-3.5 10-8 10S4 17.25 4 12V6l8-4z"/>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Safety Standards</h3>
        <p>
          From personal well-being to technical preparedness, we maintain the highest safety standards — using certified high-altitude gear and comprehensive safety protocols to ensure a secure and reliable Himalayan experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card cyan">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M21 10a9 9 0 11-9-9 9 9 0 019 9z"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>24×7 Online Support</h3>
        <p>
          We're always available — before, during, or after your trek. Reach out anytime, and you'll always hear back from a real human.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card emerald">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20 10 10 0 000-20zm0 0v5m0 5l3 3m-3-3l-3 3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>We Care for the Mountains</h3>
        <p>
          We strictly follow Leave No Trace ethics. Limited group sizes and mindful practices help protect the fragile Himalayan ecosystem.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
/* =========================================================
   SHARED SECTION STYLING
   Clean, calm, photography-led Planethimalayas style
   ========================================================= */

.about-icon-section,
.why-choose-section {
  background: #fff;
  color: #222;
  font-family: "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   ABOUT ICON SECTION
   ========================================================= */

.about-icon-section {
  padding: 1rem 0 1rem;
}

.about-icon-section h2,
.why-choose-section h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 2.35rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #111;
}

.about-icon-section h2 span,
.why-choose-section h2 span {
  color: #ff7300;
  border-bottom: 3px solid #ff7300;
  display: inline-block;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
}

.about-icon-section .subtitle,
.why-choose-section .subtitle {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0.9rem 0 1.8rem;
  font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.02rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #666;
}


/* =========================================================
   ABOUT ROWS
   ========================================================= */

.about-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 3.5rem;

  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  padding: 1.8rem 0;

  background: transparent;
  border-radius: 0;
}

.about-row.reverse {
  flex-direction: row-reverse;
}


/* =========================================================
   ABOUT ICON BOXES
   Keep the original coloured identity,
   but remove the exaggerated 3D/glow behaviour.
   ========================================================= */

.icon-box {
  width: 145px;
  height: 145px;

  flex: 0 0 145px;

  border-radius: 14px;

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;

  transition:
    transform 0.25s ease,
    box-shadow 0.25s ease;
}

.gradient-blue {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #45b6fe, #1e3c72);
}

.gradient-pink {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #b83280);
}

.gradient-green {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #0d7357);
}


/* Calm hover — no rotation, no giant glow */

.gradient-blue:hover,
.gradient-pink:hover,
.gradient-green:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
}


.icon-box svg {
  width: 68px;
  height: 68px;
  transition: transform 0.25s ease;
}

.icon-box:hover svg {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}


/* =========================================================
   ABOUT TEXT
   ========================================================= */

.text-box {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin-left: 0;
  color: #222;
}

.about-row.reverse .text-box {
  margin-left: 0;
  margin-right: 0;
}

.text-box h3 {
  margin: 0 0 0.65rem;

  font-family: "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
  font-weight: 600;

  color: #222;
}

.text-box p {
  margin: 0;

  font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.97rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  font-weight: 400;

  color: #555;
}


/* =========================================================
   SECTION SEPARATOR
   ========================================================= */

.section-separator {
  width: 100%;
  height: 1px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
}


/* =========================================================
   WHY CHOOSE US
   ========================================================= */

.why-choose-section {
  padding: 1rem 0 1rem;
}

.why-choose-section h2 {
  text-align: left;
}

.why-choose-section .subtitle {
  padding-bottom: 1.7rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   FEATURE GRID
   ========================================================= */

.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1.25rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   FEATURE CARDS
   Clean white cards instead of black/glowing cards
   ========================================================= */

.feature-card {
  background: #fff;

  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  border-radius: 11px;

  padding: 1.6rem 1.5rem;

  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.055);

  transition:
    transform 0.22s ease,
    box-shadow 0.22s ease,
    border-color 0.22s ease;
}

.feature-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);

  border-color: rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.28);

  box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.09);
}


/* =========================================================
   FEATURE ICONS
   Keep their individual colours.
   No orange glow.
   ========================================================= */

.feature-card .icon {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;

  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-start;

  margin-bottom: 1rem;

  background: transparent;
}

.feature-card .icon svg {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;

  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.feature-card:hover .icon svg {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}


/* =========================================================
   FEATURE CARD TEXT
   ========================================================= */

.feature-card h3 {
  margin: 0 0 0.55rem;

  font-family: "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
  font-weight: 600;

  color: #222;
}

.feature-card p {
  margin: 0;

  font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  line-height: 1.65;
  font-weight: 400;

  color: #666;
}


/* =========================================================
   REMOVE OLD CARD COLOUR DEPENDENCIES
   These classes remain available because they exist in HTML,
   but they no longer force different card backgrounds.
   ========================================================= */

.feature-card.yellow,
.feature-card.purple,
.feature-card.blue,
.feature-card.green,
.feature-card.cyan,
.feature-card.emerald {
  background: #fff;
}


/* =========================================================
   TABLET
   ========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 1024px) {

  .about-icon-section h2,
  .why-choose-section h2 {
    font-size: 2.15rem;
  }

  .about-row {
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

}


/* =========================================================
   MOBILE
   ========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 768px) {

  .about-icon-section,
  .why-choose-section {
    padding-left: 0;
    padding-right: 0;
  }

  .about-icon-section h2,
  .why-choose-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .about-icon-section .subtitle,
  .why-choose-section .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }


  /* About rows */

  .about-row,
  .about-row.reverse {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;

    gap: 1.25rem;

    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
  }

  .icon-box {
    width: 92px;
    height: 92px;
    flex: 0 0 92px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .icon-box svg {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
  }

  .text-box,
  .about-row.reverse .text-box {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .text-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .text-box p {
    font-size: 0.91rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }


  /* Why Choose */

  .why-choose-section {
    padding-top: 2.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: none;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.055);
  }

  .feature-card .icon {
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

}


/* =========================================================
   SMALL PHONES
   ========================================================= */

@media (max-width: 480px) {

  .about-icon-section h2,
  .why-choose-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }

  .about-icon-section .subtitle,
  .why-choose-section .subtitle {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  .about-row {
    padding: 1.1rem 0;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.1rem;
  }

}
</style>